flowchart LR
    Webhook[External Webhooks<br/>Email / Webform / IM<br/>external]
    Ingress[FastAPI Ingress Gateway<br/>HMAC verify + PII redaction<br/>design-only]
    Queue[(Celery + Redis Broker<br/>async task queue<br/>design-only)]
    Extractor[External LLM Extractor<br/>Claude / GPT JSON mode<br/>design-only]
    Policy[Deterministic Policy Engine<br/>implemented locally]
    CRM[(PostgreSQL + pgvector CRM<br/>dedup + account enrichment<br/>design-only)]
    Slack[Slack Interactive HITL<br/>Block Kit approval UI<br/>design-only]
    Approval[ApprovalCommand Generator<br/>HMAC-SHA256 signature<br/>implemented locally]
    Dispatcher[Outbound SMTP / API Dispatcher<br/>SendGrid / SES client<br/>design-only]
    AuditStore[(PostgreSQL Audit Ledger<br/>append-only table<br/>design-only)]
    DLQ[(Dead-Letter Queue / DLQ<br/>design-only)]

    Webhook -->|HTTPS POST| Ingress
    Ingress -->|rejected| DLQ
    Ingress -->|InboundEnvelope| Queue
    Queue --> Extractor
    Extractor -->|InboundTriageResult| Policy
    Policy -->|CRM candidate| CRM
    CRM -->|enriched lead| Slack
    Policy -->|spam / injection / low confidence| DLQ
    Slack -->|human sign-off| Approval
    Approval -->|verified command| Dispatcher
    Dispatcher -->|sent email| AuditStore
    Dispatcher -->|provider failure| DLQ

    Ingress -.-> AuditStore
    Policy -.-> AuditStore
    Approval -.-> AuditStore
    DLQ -.-> AuditStore

